@Basket.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5102

### Get basket for demo-user
GET {{Basket.Api_HostAddress}}/baskets/demo-user

###

### Get basket for a buyer with no basket (expect empty items)
GET {{Basket.Api_HostAddress}}/baskets/new-buyer

###

### Add product 1 to demo-user (first add: new line, quantity 1)
POST {{Basket.Api_HostAddress}}/baskets/demo-user/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }

###

### Add product 1 again (increments the existing line to quantity 2)
POST {{Basket.Api_HostAddress}}/baskets/demo-user/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 1, "quantity": 1 }

###

### Add product 2 (second line with Catalog's name and price)
POST {{Basket.Api_HostAddress}}/baskets/demo-user/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 2, "quantity": 1 }

###

### Add an unknown product (expect 404, basket unchanged)
POST {{Basket.Api_HostAddress}}/baskets/demo-user/items
Content-Type: application/json

{ "productId": 999, "quantity": 1 }

###

### Remove product 2 from demo-user (expect only product 1 left)
DELETE {{Basket.Api_HostAddress}}/baskets/demo-user/items/2

###

### Remove a product that isn't in the basket (expect 200, basket unchanged)
DELETE {{Basket.Api_HostAddress}}/baskets/demo-user/items/999

###
